    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Ayesha Mian, an associate professor in psychiatry at AKU and head of the University's Gender Equality programme, has been awarded the American Academy of Child and Adolescent Psychiatry's Jeanne Spurlock, MD, Award on Diversity and Culture in recognition of her enduring efforts to advance and promote the field of child and adolescent psychiatry and build capacity in the field.",
